foundation.question_text:
This square block of land is $100$ m long and $100$ m wide.
Record its area in hectares.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0); \coordinate (B) at (4,0); \coordinate (C) at (4,4); \coordinate (D) at (0,4);
\draw (A) -- (B) node[midway,below] {$100\text{ m}$};
\draw (B) -- (C) node[midway,right] {$100\text{ m}$};
\draw (C) -- (D); \draw (D) -- (A);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
